      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مُغَثْرِيَةٌ</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَدَ المَآءَ مُغَثْرِيًا عَلَيْهِ</span>
means <i>He found the water to be thronged:</i> (K,
TA:) or, accord. to Sgh, (TA,) you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَدْتُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَآءَ مُغَثْرِيًا بِالوِرْدِ</span> <i>I found the water to be thronged
by the coming thereto.</i> (O, TA.)

